   "en": "Akuyaku Reijou wa Single Mother ni Narimashita Futago wo Hikitorimashitaga Koushaku-sama kara no Dekiai wa Souteigaidesu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "悪役令嬢はシングルマザーになりました 双子を引き取りましたが公爵様からの溺愛は想定外です"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Akuyaku Reijou wa Single Mother ni Narimashita Futago wo Hikitorimashitaga Koushaku-sama kara no Dekiai wa Souteigaidesu"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Estelle, once a noble duchess, is cast down to commoner status after the crown prince abruptly ends their engagement—unaware that she's been reincarnated as the villainess in a game. Determined to live quietly, she moves to a neighbouring country and begins working at a small restaurant.\n\nSix years later, Estelle is running the restaurant while raising Coco and Mia, the twin daughters of the late owner. Her peaceful life is upended when Duke Frederick, who claims to be the twins’ older brother, suddenly appears. To protect the girls from being caught in a bitter inheritance dispute, Estelle agrees to pose as his lover.\n\nThus begins a romantic fantasy between a cold-hearted duke and a villainess who now finds herself at the mercy of the very man she must pretend to love."
  },
